-- CASE-INSENSITIVE VIEW ESCAPE HATCH (optional)
-- If you'd rather NOT change any of your existing Go query strings (which
-- reference columns as `User_Id`, `MedicineName`, etc. without quotes),
-- Postgres will lowercase them and fail.  Easiest fix: add lowercase views:
--
--   CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW v_userdata AS
--     SELECT "User_Id" AS user_id, "User" AS "user",
--            "Password" AS password, "Role" AS role FROM userdata;
--
-- and point queries at the views.  Skip this if you'll rewrite queries for
-- Postgres anyway.
-- ============================================================================
